# Default image mapping for `act` in this repo.
#
# Maps `ubuntu-latest` to the catthehacker image for the Ubuntu release GitHub's
# ubuntu-latest runs (26.04). It ships Node.js on PATH, which the JS actions
# (checkout, setup-node) need; setup-node then installs the matrix version.
# act pulls the image on every run, so it stays current.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-26.04
